    "name": "One Way Road",
    "steam_appid": 1599490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/7081045e23fa7505d21fa9e25a1678f1.poster.avif?t=1754325865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/7081045e23fa7505d21fa9e25a1678f1.webm?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/7081045e23fa7505d21fa9e25a1678f1.mp4?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/08533994d6a77afc1b2a791819e0cef8.avif?t=1754325865\" /></div><br>Humanity is turning its gaze towards space in the near future. A brand-new era has begun - the era of space exploration. When the planets of our solar system were settled, it was time to explore and colonize other worlds and star systems. A once-impossible dream became a reality. As science has reached unprecedented heights, people across the globe have become more united, forgetting about age-old conflicts and feuds. <br><br>However, along with great discoveries, new troubles appeared in people's lives. The long- awaited encounters with extraterrestrial civilizations led to a fresh round of conflicts, and the competition for resources and habitable territories further exacerbated differences between species. It did not go unnoticed when a new player appeared on the galaxy map and a large number of bloody wars broke out. A formidable rival is approaching us from the very center of the galaxy. Its power is immeasurable, and its intentions are unknown.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/469a0e551c8e3b0d1ea42b928c068c78.poster.avif?t=1754325865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/469a0e551c8e3b0d1ea42b928c068c78.webm?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/469a0e551c8e3b0d1ea42b928c068c78.mp4?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The player will take control of a spaceship as the captain of Space Fleet Command, James Dekker. Together with a team of recruits, on a battle-worn ship, you will look into the most remote corners of the galaxy, engage in fierce space combat, fight with entire fleets, and protect not only the Earth but all of humanity.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/9989e10a93e9018ff5d7a2e69f4289cc.avif?t=1754325865\" /></div><br><strong>A captivating storyline.</strong><br>Experience a world where moral dilemmas can turn friends and allies into enemies, and utterly devastate worlds. Discover what it means to be in charge of your team from the perspective of a hardened and sometimes cynical war veteran. Build a branching narrative that will determine not only the fate of the main characters, but the survival of the entire universe as well.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/3ea51c43b5bbb93391aa95cd519d787b.poster.avif?t=1754325865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/3ea51c43b5bbb93391aa95cd519d787b.webm?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/3ea51c43b5bbb93391aa95cd519d787b.mp4?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Cinematic experience.</strong><br>Almost seamlessly blending interactive cutscenes with gameplay One Way Road delivers one of the most cinematic, expansive and life-like journeys through the Galaxy war. The game\u2019s on-screen direction will keep you engaged till the end credits roll.<br><br><strong>Change the course of the story.</strong><br>It is up to you and your decisions to determine the fate of humanity. Making a choice can have a significant effect on the outcome of your story both locally and on a global scale.<br><br><strong>Progression system.</strong><br>As you travel, you will earn Experience points that can be used to upgrade your ship's systems and install new equipment. It is up to you to adjust your ship to suit your style of play or to adapt yourself and master your chosen battle tactics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/d7d0fa34e9acb10b8ff2bfc2c567920e.poster.avif?t=1754325865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/d7d0fa34e9acb10b8ff2bfc2c567920e.webm?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/d7d0fa34e9acb10b8ff2bfc2c567920e.mp4?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Explore the galaxy's far reaches.</strong><br>Engage in space combat and battle on planet surfaces. Drive a spaceship through dense asteroid fields, chase down a hurling comet, or explore a gigantic space station that's full of dark labyrinths.<br><br><strong>Gameplay mechanics intertwined.</strong><br>The game is blending several action mechanics in order to create an action packed space story.<br>- The Scroll Shooter mode allows you to control a Starfleet heavy cruiser that is powerful enough to take out entire fleets.<br>- The Top-down Shooter mode puts you in control of a small, nimble space-fighter jet.<br>- The Tube Shooter mode enables you to chase the enemy, destroying everything that stands in your way.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/8d7b8b4c9d43cadd78855a168a63046a.poster.avif?t=1754325865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/8d7b8b4c9d43cadd78855a168a63046a.webm?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/8d7b8b4c9d43cadd78855a168a63046a.mp4?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
