essly blending interactive cutscenes with gameplay One Way Road delivers one of the most cinematic, expansive and life-like journeys through the Galaxy war. The game\u2019s on-screen direction will keep you engaged till the end credits roll.<br><br><strong>Change the course of the story.</strong><br>It is up to you and your decisions to determine the fate of humanity. Making a choice can have a significant effect on the outcome of your story both locally and on a global scale.<br><br><strong>Progression system.</strong><br>As you travel, you will earn Experience points that can be used to upgrade your ship's systems and install new equipment. It is up to you to adjust your ship to suit your style of play or to adapt yourself and master your chosen battle tactics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/d7d0fa34e9acb10b8ff2bfc2c567920e.poster.avif?t=1754325865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/d7d0fa34e9acb10b8ff2bfc2c567920e.webm?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/d7d0fa34e9acb10b8ff2bfc2c567920e.mp4?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Explore the galaxy's far reaches.</strong><br>Engage in space combat and battle on planet surfaces. Drive a spaceship through dense asteroid fields, chase down a hurling comet, or explore a gigantic space station that's full of dark labyrinths.<br><br><strong>Gameplay mechanics intertwined.</strong><br>The game is blending several action mechanics in order to create an action packed space story.<br>- The Scroll Shooter mode allows you to control a Starfleet heavy cruiser that is powerful enough to take out entire fleets.<br>- The Top-down Shooter mode puts you in control of a small, nimble space-fighter jet.<br>- The Tube Shooter mode enables you to chase the enemy, destroying everything that stands in your way.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/8d7b8b4c9d43cadd78855a168a63046a.poster.avif?t=1754325865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/8d7b8b4c9d43cadd78855a168a63046a.webm?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599490/extras/8d7b8b4c9d43cadd78855a168a63046a.mp4?t=1754325865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
